%  Relevant files
InitCondFile      tests/TemperatureStep/conduction_1a_wendlandc6.ic

% CPU-time limit %%%%%%%%%%%%%% TimeLimitCPU*0.6=BetRest
TimeLimitCPU      1728000
CpuTimeBetRestartFile  900

%  Caracteristics of run
MaxMemSize          1200
TimeBegin           0.0
TimeMax             0.005

BoxSize                1.0
PeriodicBoundariesOn   1


% Output frequency

TimeBetSnapshot        0.0005
TimeOfFirstSnapshot    0

MaxSizeTimestep        0.005

%  Parameters of SPH


ArtBulkViscConst    2.0


% Further code parameters

PartAllocFactor       3.0

BufferSize              20

% System of units

UnitLength_in_cm         1.0
UnitMass_in_g            1.0
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s 1.0


% Softening lengths

SofteningGas       0.000051  % 0.4

SofteningGasMaxPhys       0.000051  %0.4


% conduction @todo

ConductionEfficiency 1.0
MaxSizeConductionStep 2.5E-4
